	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, I’ll walk you to your\nMulti Battle Room.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the\nhomie {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the homies\n{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, follow me to the\nBattle Salon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Tower!\rI run the Wi-Fi Battle Rooms.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tryna run the Wi-Fi Battle\nRoom challenge? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Wi-Fi Battle Rooms is where\nyou scrap over Nintendo Wi-Fi\fConnection.\rSo you scrappin’ Hustlers from\nall around the world.\rThis tower got a LOT of\nBattle Rooms.\rIn every Battle Room, seven\nHustlers waitin’ on you.\rBeat all seven, and you\nget Battle Points.\rDependin’ how you do, you might\neven run the whole room!\rAlso, the Wi-Fi Battle Rooms\ngot a rankin’ system.\rKeep winnin’ and your rank\ngo up.\rKeep losin’ and your rank\nfall off. Like a rapper.\rWanna climb? Keep winnin’,\nespecially on tough Hustlers.\rIf you wanna dip mid-run,\nsave the game first.\rIf you don’t save, you\ngettin’ disqualified. No cap.\rDon’t say I ain’t warn you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back when you got the heart!</language>
	</row>
