	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I downloaded the Rank {STRVAR_1 51, 0, 0} Battle\nRoom {STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0} leader history.\rPeep it on the Performance\nMonitor right next to me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for playin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyy, congrats!\nYou ran through all seven Hustlers!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you also got bumped\nup to Rank {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0}! Promoted!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Savin’...\nDon’t you DARE turn it off.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna send these results\nover Nintendo WFC? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For that 7-win streak, here\ngo your BP!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\n{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} BP.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
