		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your results got sent over\nNintendo WFC!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good to see you back.\rYour last results ain’t get sent\nover Nintendo WFC.\rYou wanna send ’em now? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
