	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Savin’ your record.\nHold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats on hittin’ Rank {STRVAR_1 51, 0, 0}.\nYour squad just won\fspecial Ribbons for that!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats on that 50-win streak.\fYour squad just won\fspecial Ribbons for that!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">See? The Battle Frontier a\nwhole vibe.\rYou know what?\rWord is there’s spots like this\noutside of Johto too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for playin’!\rYour homies gon’ get healed\nup to full...\fOh, my bad!\rI ain’t on the clock today.\nI’m just here chillin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Me?\rI just debuted as a Idol!\fI ain’t booked no gigs yet.\rSo whenever I got time, I come here\nand scrap with my homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I trained my lil guy till we\nlegit couldn’t train no more.\rHe finna do a 50-win streak\nfor sure...\rRight, PIKACHU?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PIKACHU: ...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I always loved these see-through\nelevators since I was lil.\fOr not!\rWhen I was lil, these elevators\nain’t even exist!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tee hee!\nAll these Hustlers around us look\fso washed!\r...Actually, that mind-set is how\nyou get one-shotted.\rDon’t get cocky, PIKACHU!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PIKACHU: Pichuu! Pichuu!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats on that 50-win streak!\rYour squad gettin’ commemorative\nRibbons. Drip.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats on movin’ up to\nRank {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0}!\rYour squad gettin’ commemorative\nRibbons. Drip.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats on beatin’\nthe Tower Tycoon!\fYour squad gettin’ commemorative\fRibbons. Drip.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyy, congrats!\rFor that W, we givin’ you\nthis souvenir print!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Gold Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Silver Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats on that\n{STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}-win streak!\rHere’s a trophy for bein’\na problem!\fWe’ll ship it to your crib.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Uh-oh... You ain’t got no room\nfor decorations.\rClear some space and come back\nfor your prize.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the homies\n{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">’scuse me!\rYou don’t have {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} eligible Pokémon.\rYou must have {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} different Pokémon\nto enter.\rThey also must be holdin’ different\nkinds of items.\rEggs are not allowed to enter.\rPlease come see me when you ready.</language>
	</row>
