	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00110" index="110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for pullin’ up!\nCome back anytime!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00111" index="111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ain’t no data yet...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00112" index="112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DS Wireless Communications\nfinna launch. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00113" index="113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back soon, hear?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00114" index="114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Call me the Judge.\rHeheh, it ain’t my real name,\nbut that’s what everybody call me.\rIt’s ’cause of this weird power I\ngot. It’s a gift, fr.\rI can see--JUDGE, you could say--the\nfull potential of any homie.\rIf you want, I’ll judge the\npotential of your homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00115" index="115">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you want, I’ll judge the\npotential of your homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00116" index="116">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Oh.\nYou don’t need me to judge. Bet.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00117" index="117">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Judge a Egg?!\nThat’s a reach even for me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00118" index="118">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see, I see...\rThis homie’s potential is decent\nall around.\rThat’s my verdict, and it’s final.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00119" index="119">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see, I see...\rThis homie’s potential is above\naverage overall.\rThat’s my verdict, and it’s final.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00120" index="120">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see, I see...\rThis homie got pretty strong\npotential overall.\rThat’s my verdict, and it’s final.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00121" index="121">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see, I see...\rThis homie got OUTSTANDING\npotential overall. A real one.\rThat’s my verdict, and it’s final.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00122" index="122">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’d say its best\npotential is in its HP.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00123" index="123">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’d say its best\npotential is in its Attack.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00124" index="124">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’d say its best\npotential is in its Defense.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00125" index="125">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’d say its best\npotential is in its Sp. Atk.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00126" index="126">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’d say its best\npotential is in its Sp. Def.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00127" index="127">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, I’d say its best\npotential is in its Speed.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00128" index="128">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s pretty decent there.\nThat’s my judgment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00129" index="129">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s real good there.\nThat’s my judgment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00130" index="130">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s fantastic there.\nThat’s my judgment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00131" index="131">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It can’t get no better than that.\nThat’s my judgment. Gas.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0096_D31R0201_00132" index="132">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Ribbon goin’ to the\nhomie that scrapped!</language>
	</row>
</body>
